text:
no age key at HOME/.config/winch/age.key
set WINCH_AGE_KEY to a key file, or WINCH_AGE_IDENTITY_CMD to a command that prints a key
to make a key, run winch secret init; then a member who can read the secrets runs winch secret rekey
